## Gate repair

    d107814  safari/run.sh reads safari's arm-gaps.tsv instead of a copy

`treesspec` had been reported WRONG for three days while the answer sat in
`spec/arm-gaps.tsv` one repo over. Not a regression; issue 125's third
instance. Confirmed independently: Cobblestone reads `11.700000000000001` as
bits ...750 where correctly-rounded is ...751.

