## Evening: five gaps of one shape

Every one a fact the parser earned and a later layer never read.

    5baad8d  punctual reaches the wire; the def flags are not always zero
    890af01  linear strips at param bind, unique-params, revised
    d6f49f6  lowering never refuses a field access; CDX2005 instead
    c8a703a  a unit type is a constructor arrow; CDX2095 can fire
    3342e3a  a unit family is two definitions per member
    f5c0a2c  a class is a record type, an instance is three definitions
    3095ae4  an undeclared definition learns its effect row from its body
    3c86c28  an effect operation is a name, and we bound none of them

Corpus refusals 38 -> 28. Corpus counters 988 -> 994 agree of 1,032 comparable.
The graded five never moved.

**The near-miss worth remembering:** the unit-family cut named every member
`"    "` (lossless CST -- the first token is whitespace). Four units still went
byte-identical and all five counters stayed exact, because those definitions
are unreachable and pruned before emission. Counter agreement was satisfied for
entirely the wrong reason; only a test that read the NAMES caught it.

